WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:04,020
Brother Wang, Su Qing, forget about going to the company to ask for letters.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,820
Sir, haven't you always wanted to resign?

3
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:09,710
I suddenly felt quite boring

4
00:00:09,710 --> 00:00:11,310
See what happened to that receptionist

5
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:14,190
I will take you now to save the company Baipu, the drug Yangwei

6
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:16,990
What's the difference between that and the vain receptionist?

7
00:00:16,990 --> 00:00:18,830
Just three or four thousand yuan, I don’t mind.

8
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:21,870
Even if it is only three or four thousand yuan, it is still the income of your labor

9
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,870
We can't lose even a cent of what we deserve.

10
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:24,910
Sister Su, you are right

11
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,750
Brother Wang, let’s go to Xinghuo Building

12
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,890
Sister Su, don’t you think you’ll have to forgive me later?

13
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:33,090
Don't worry, our license depends on the occasion.

14
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:34,610
There’s no need to resign with you

15
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:37,250
My sister promises to be obedient and return all the buttons to you.

16
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:39,790
Li Che?

17
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:40,830
Brother Huang?

18
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:42,350
Li Che, who are they?

19
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,190
Dear from my hometown, come and do some errands with me

20
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:46,080
scared me

21
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:47,920
I thought the leader came down to inspect

22
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,440
By the way, you haven't been here these two days

23
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:50,560
Zhu Tou San is crazy with anger

24
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,560
Why is he angry when I adjust my cultivation normally?

25
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,840
Pig Tou San wants to please his boss

26
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,040
Forcing everyone to work overtime for free

27
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,460
If you don't answer the phone, they say they'll deduct 5,000 yuan from you.

28
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:58,900
I took classes for a month

29
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,220
If you don't give him a cent, you still have to pay him five thousand.

30
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:05,620
You're miserable, why did you bring me to kiss your family today?

31
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,220
I brought them here to resign today.
